==Crimean Gothic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|gme-cgo}} {{m|gem-pro|*hailiją}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|gme-cgo}} {{m|gem-pro|*hailaz}}; compare Gothic {{m|got|𐌷𐌰𐌹𐌻𐍃}}.

===Noun===
{{head|gme-cgo|noun}}

# [[life]], [[health]]
#* 1562, Ogier Ghiselin de Busbecq:
#*: '''Iel'''. Vita sive sanitas.

====Derived terms====
* {{l|gme-cgo|iel vburt}}

